### Test Whatsapp webhook
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/webhooks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "message": "test handler"
}

### ⚠️ Send Whatsapp message (does not work if the user has not initiated first or pass 24h conversation session)
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/test/message
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "to": "48518121343",
    "message": "test message"
}

### Send Whatsapp template
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/test/template
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "to": "48518121343",
    "template": "onboarding_language_choice",
    "language": "en"
}

### Register PROD number
POST {{metaUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/{{phoneNumberId}}/register
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "messaging_product": "whatsapp",
    "pin": "482731"
}

